# Story 10.1b/10.1c live-validation artifacts.
#
# What is committed: the ADJUDICATION images — the side-by-side grids and pair sheets a
# reader needs to check the verdicts in the story files — plus the scripts and reports that
# re-derive every number. Roughly 20 MB of the ~520 MB this directory holds.
#
# What is ignored: the raw renders those grids were built FROM (per-plate sweep outputs,
# per-variant probe frames, extracted stills, full videos). They are large, they are
# regenerable from the committed scripts against the same run, and no claim in the stories
# rests on a reader opening one of them directly.
#
# Exception worth knowing: `off/` holds the ONLY surviving copy of the pre-8.16 render Jay
# originally watched (video.py:1885 unlinks shot clips on every re-render, so it cannot be
# rebuilt). It stays out of git for size, but do not delete it from disk.

*.mp4
*.png

# …except the comparison sheets the verdicts cite.
!*_pair.jpg
!grid_*.jpg
!pair*.jpg
!chk_*.jpg
!diff_*.jpg
!_zoom_*.jpg
!*.md
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.json
